  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_5711.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Inauguraci&oacute;n de la exposici&oacute;n de Pere Ribera, Albert Escrig, Jos&eacute; Vicente Roig y&nbsp;Marcos Vicent, &#39;Somnis d&#39;altres&#39;, comisariada por el ondense Joan Feliu Franch,&nbsp;en el Centro de Empleo y Cultura. Inauguraci&oacute;n de la muestra y charla &#39;Mem&ograve;ria de l&#39;oblit&#39; por Ernest Nab&agrave;s Orenga (fotos) y Daniel Gozalbo Bell&eacute;s (pintura), organizada por Dones Progressistes dentro del Mar&ccedil; de la Dona, en la Caja Rural de Onda. Y presentaci&oacute;n de la XI Pujada al Mont&iacute; en La Cassola. Todo en 77 fotos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresculturalesportiu140314/img_5688.jpg\" alt=\"img_5688\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresculturalesportiu140314/img_5689.jpg\" alt=\"img_5689\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresculturalesportiu140314/img_5690.jpg\" alt=\"img_5690\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresculturalesportiu140314/img_5691.jpg\" alt=\"img_5691\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresculturalesportiu140314/img_5692.jpg\" alt=\"img_5692\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresculturalesportiu140314/img_5693.jpg\" alt=\"img_5693\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresculturalesportiu140314/img_5694.jpg\" alt=\"img_5694\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:au